# Results and Conclusions
Forecast graphs highlight vital regions for Inclusive Development International and PalmWatch to observe across later years
Our maps show regions, like Riau, that experienced a higher rate of total deforestation
Riau’s resource-rich environment makes it a prime area for continued deforestation  
Despite its recent decline, we expect deforestation to have a marginal increase

# Impact and Future Work
Our study provides the framework to anticipate the future dangers of deforestation across Sumatra. PalmWatch can leverage these forecasts to identify areas of risk and prioritize conservation efforts. As of future work, we can expand our models to predict past 2023 and how Indonesian policies impacts deforestation. 
